<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { titulo: titulo }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-neutral-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main id="contenido">
    <!-- ── PORTADA ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50 via-white to-white dark:from-slate-800 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-900">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-70 dark:opacity-20" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle,#bfdbfe 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:24px 24px" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 text-center">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">Información institucional</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-balance">
          Nosotros
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Conoce quiénes somos y consulta nuestras políticas y condiciones de uso.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── SUBPÁGINAS ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">        <a href="/nosotros/quienes-somos" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:border-primary-300 dark:hover:border-primary-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary-950/[0.07] transition p-6">
          <span class="inline-grid place-items-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-50 dark:bg-slate-700 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 group-hover:bg-primary-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-1a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M9 20H4v-1a4 4 0 0 1 3-3.87m6-1.13a4 4 0 1 0-4-4 4 4 0 0 0 4 4Z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 group-hover:text-primary-700 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors">Quiénes somos</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 dark:text-slate-400 grow">Nuestra historia, misión y visión como directorio virtual de las empresas y pymes de Colombia.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">Ver más
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/nosotros/terminos" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:border-primary-300 dark:hover:border-primary-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary-950/[0.07] transition p-6">
          <span class="inline-grid place-items-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-50 dark:bg-slate-700 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 group-hover:bg-primary-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 group-hover:text-primary-700 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors">Términos y condiciones</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 dark:text-slate-400 grow">Contrato con las condiciones generales aplicables al uso de los servicios de MiDirectorioCerca.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">Ver más
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="/nosotros/privacidad" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:border-primary-300 dark:hover:border-primary-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary-950/[0.07] transition p-6">
          <span class="inline-grid place-items-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-accent-50 dark:bg-slate-700 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 group-hover:bg-primary-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3 4.5 6v5c0 4.5 3 8.4 7.5 10 4.5-1.6 7.5-5.5 7.5-10V6L12 3Zm0 6v4m0 3h.01"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 group-hover:text-primary-700 dark:group-hover:text-primary-400 transition-colors">Políticas y privacidad</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-500 dark:text-slate-400 grow">Condiciones de uso, protección de datos personales y política de cookies.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">Ver más
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-primary-600 text-white p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
        <p class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold">¿Quieres hacer parte del directorio?</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-primary-100">Publica tu empresa por una mínima cuota anual y llega a más clientes.</p>
        <a href="/contacto" class="inline-grid place-items-center h-11 px-6 mt-5 rounded-xl bg-accent-400 hover:bg-accent-300 text-neutral-900 font-bold transition-colors">Contáctanos</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
